# Base URL of the Dr. Lokmandas ERP backend (the Express server in this repo).
#
# The Vercel site (lockmandas-school-erp-web.vercel.app) is the PUBLIC WEBSITE
# ONLY — it does not serve the /api backend. Point this at wherever the Express
# server runs.
#
# • Android emulator  -> http://10.0.2.2:3000
# • iOS simulator     -> http://localhost:3000
# • Real phone (Expo Go) on the same Wi-Fi as your PC:
#     use your computer's LAN IP, e.g. http://192.168.1.23:3000
#     (find it with `ipconfig` on Windows -> "IPv4 Address")
#
# Copy this file to .env and edit the value, then restart `npm start`.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://localhost:3000
